ined from bamboo: effect of the oxygen content","volume":"27","issue":"36","page":"365708","doi":"10.1088/0957-4484/27/36/365708","url":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1088/0957-4484/27/36/365708"},"associated_spectra":[{"name":"Oxidized-graphenic Nanoplatelets Obtained From Bamboo – Low Oxygen","link":"https://eelsdb.eu/spectra/oxidized-graphenic-nanoplatelets-obtained-from-bamboo-low-oxygen/","type":"Core Loss"}]}');
INSERT INTO spectra (id, slug, status, title, type, technique, intensity_units, formula, source_purity, description, min_energy_ev, max_energy_ev, step_ev, author_display, author_slug, published_at, created_at, completeness, legacy_rank, legacy_v1) VALUES (21627, 'melamine-powder', 'published', 'Melamine Powder', 'coreloss', 'eels', 'counts', 'C3N6H6', 'Aldrich 99%', 'The experiment was performed with the chronospectroscopy mode, every spectrun was acquired using an acquisition time of 9 millisecond. The submitted spectrum is a collection of 10 spectrum. Analyst: Susana Trasobares. Temperature: Room. ', 257.11, 467.6, 0.206, 'Susana Trasobares', 'strasos', '2007-11-19 00:00:00', '2007-11-19 00:00:00', 'full', 77, '{"id":21627,"title":"Melamine Powder","permalink":"https://eelsdb.eu/spectra/melamine-powder/","author":{"name":"Susana Trasobares","profile_url":"https://eelsdb.eu/author/strasos/","profile_api_url":"https://api.eelsdb.eu/author/strasos/"},"published":"2007-11-19 00:00:00","description":"The experiment was performed with the chronospectroscopy mode, every spectrun was acquired using an acquisition time of 9 millisecond. The submitted spectrum is a collection of 10 spectrum. Analyst: Susana Trasobares. Temperature: Room. ","comment_count":0,"api_permalink":"https://api.eelsdb.eu/spectra/melamine-powder/","keywords":["imported from old site"],"download_link":"https://eelsdb.eu/wp-content/uploads/2015/09/DspecUTi8lE.msa","type":"Core Loss","formula":"C3N6H6","elements":["C","N","H"],"microscope":"VG HB501","max_energy":"467.6 eV","min_energy":"257.11 eV","source_purity":"Aldrich 99%","edges":["C_K"],"guntype":"Cold FEG","beamenergy":"100 kV","monochromated":"No","stepSize":"0.206 eV/pixel","convergence":"15 mrad","collection":"24 mrad","probesize":"0.5 nm^2","beamcurrent":"0.2","integratetime":"0.090 secs","detector":"Parallel: 666 Gatan","darkcurrent":"Yes","gainvariation":"Yes","other_links":[{"url":"http://pc-web.cemes.fr/eelsdb/index.php?page=displayspec.php&id=114","title":"Old EELS DB"}]}');
INSERT INTO spectra (id, slug, status, title, type, technique, intensity_units, formula, source_purity, description, min_energy_ev, max_energy_ev, step_ev, author_display, author_slug, published_at, created_at, completeness, legacy_rank, legacy_v1) VALUES (21628, 'melamine-powder-irradiated', 'published', 'Melamine Powder -Irradiated', 'coreloss', 'eels', 'counts', 'C3N6H6', 'Aldrich 99%', 'The experiment was performed with the chronospectroscopy mode, every spectrun was acquired using an acquisition time of 9 millisecond. The submitted spectrum is a collection of 10 spectra.' || char(13) || '' || char(10) || 'Melamine is really sensitive to beam damage, after 0.4 seconds the origianl melamine spectra is transformed into the spectrun submitted here. Analyst: Susana Trasobares. Temperature: Room. ', 244.41, 457.19, 0.208, 'Susana Trasobares', 'strasos', '2007-11-19 00:00:00', '2007-11-19 00:00:00', 'full', 78, '{"id":21628,"title":"Melamine Powder -Irradiated","permalink":"https://eelsdb.eu/spectra/melamine-powder-irradiated/","author":{"name":"Susana Trasobares","profile_url":"https://eelsdb.eu/author/strasos/","profile_api_url":"https://api.eelsdb.eu/author/strasos/"},"published":"2007-11-19 00:00:00","description":"The experiment was performed with the chronospectroscopy mode, every spectrun was acquired using an acquisition time of 9 millisecond. The submitted spectrum is a collection of 10 spectra.\r\nMelamine is really sensitive to beam damage, after 0.4 seconds the origianl melamine spectra is transformed into the spectrun submitted here. Analyst: Susana Trasobares. Temperature: Room. ","comment_count":0,"api_permalink":"https://api.eelsdb.eu/spectra/melamine-powder-irradiated/","keywords":["imported from old site"],"download_link":"https://eelsdb.eu/wp-content/uploads/2015/09/DspecvHYEok.msa","type":"Core Loss","formula":"C3N6H6","elements":["C","N","H"],"microscope":"VG HB501","max_energy":"457.19 eV","min_energy":"244.41 eV","source_purity":"Aldrich 99%","edges":["C_K"],"guntype":"Cold FEG","beamenergy":"100 kV","monochromated":"No","stepSize":"0.208 eV/pixel","convergence":"15 mrad","collection":"24 mrad","probesize":"0.5 nm^2","detector":"Parallel: 666 Gatan","darkcurrent":"Yes","gainvariation":"Yes","reference":{"authors":"Susana Trasobares, Christine Kolczewski, Riitta Räty, Niclas Borglund, Arianna Bassan, Gilles Hug, Christian Colliex, Stefan Csillag, Lars G. M. Pettersson","year":"2003","journal":"J. Phys. Chem. A","title":"Monitoring the Decomposition of Melamine in the Solid Phase by Electron Energy Loss Chronospectroscopy","volume":"107","issue":"2","page":"228-235","doi":"10.1021/jp026340j","url":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jp026340j"},"other_links":[{"url":"http://pc-web.cemes.fr/eelsdb/index.php?page=displayspec.php&id=115","title":"Old EELS DB"}]}');
INSERT INTO spectra (id, slug, status, title, type, technique, intensity_units, formula, source_purity, description, min_energy_ev, max_energy_ev, step_ev, author_display, author_slug, published_at, created_at, completeness, legacy_rank, legacy_v1) VALUES (21985, 'cacoo-misfit-nt', 'published', 'CaCoO Misfit Nanotube', 'coreloss', 'eels', 'counts', 'CaCoO2−CoO2', NULL, '', 254.84, 1099.59, 0.526, 'Luc Lajaunie', 'luc-lajaunie', '2016-06-12 21:03:46', '2016-06-12 21:03:46', 'full', 79, '{"id":21985,"title":"CaCoO Misfit Nanotube","permalink":"https://eelsdb.eu/spectra/cacoo-misfit-nt/","author":{"name":"Luc Lajaunie","profile_url":"https://eelsdb.eu/author/luc-lajaunie/","profile_api_url":"https://api.eelsdb.eu/author/luc-lajaunie/"},"published":"2016-06-12 21:03:46","description":"","comment_count":0,"api_permalink":"https://api.eelsdb.eu/spectra/cacoo-misfit-nt/","download_link":"https://eelsdb.eu/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/CaCoO-NT-2.msa","type":"Core Loss","formula":"CaCoO2−CoO2","elements":["Ca","Co","O"],"microscope":"FEI Titan Low-Base","max_energy":"1099.59 eV","min_energy":"254.84 eV","edges":["Co_L2,3","O_K","Ca_L2,3","Ca_L1"],"guntype":"X-FEG","beamenergy":"200 kV","resolution":"1.5 eV","monochromated":"No","stepSize":"0.526 eV/pixel","acquisition_mode":"stem","convergence":"18 mrad","collection":"10 mrad","detector":"Gatan Tridiem ESR 865","darkcurrent":"No","gainvariation":"No","calibration":"low loss + drift tube","reference":{"authors":"Leela S. Panchakarla, Luc Lajaunie, Ashwin Ramasubramaniam, Raul Arenal, Reshef Tenne","year":"2016","journal":"ACS Nano","title":"Nanotubes from Oxide-Based Misfit Family: The Case of Calcium Cobalt Oxide","doi":"10.1021/acsnano.6b02430","url":"http://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acsnano.6b02430"}}');
