 (perovskite structure)","link":"https://eelsdb.eu/spectra/calcium-titanate-perovskite-structure-3/","type":"Core Loss"}],"other_links":[{"url":"http://pc-web.cemes.fr/eelsdb/index.php?page=displayspec.php&id=131","title":"Old EELS DB"}]}');
